"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Wiederholung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">R2</div><h1>통합 복습 2</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wiederholung 2 · Lektion 12–20</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 12부터 20까지 배운 문법을 섞어서 풀어요.<br>여러 과의 문법이 한 문장에 함께 나와요. 기본 7 · 중간 5 · 도전 4 문제예요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 복습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">현재완료와 과거형을 골라 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">전치사의 격과 장소 표현을 함께 확인해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">재귀동사와 전치사 동사, 접속사의 어순을 섞어서 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"5a49950528\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Gestern <span class=\"qblank\"></span> wir mit dem Zug nach Gangneung gefahren.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) seid</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) hatten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) haben</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fahren은 sein과 함께 현재완료를 만들어요 (12과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fcaa3da7c6\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Wir warten schon lange <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> die Antwort.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 벌써 오래 답을 기다리고 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir warten schon lange <b>auf</b> die Antwort.</div>warten은 auf + 4격과 써요 (18과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6db4901976\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Der Laptop steht <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Schreibtisch.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) auf dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) auf der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) in den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) auf den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">있는 곳(Wo?)은 3격이에요. der Schreibtisch → auf dem (15과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5535ec38a7\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;rasiert&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(rasieren)</span> sich jeden Morgen.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 매일 아침 면도해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er <b>rasiert</b> sich jeden Morgen.</div>sich rasieren의 er 형태예요 (17과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"91d0a07eb3\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"1\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 어제 오래 잤어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">bin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">lange</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">geschlafen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Ich habe gestern lange geschlafen.</b></div>schlafen은 장소나 상태가 바뀌지 않아서 haben과 써요 (12과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a31b32c92f\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie hat ihre Schwester abgeholt.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> 현재완료로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Sie holt ihre Schwester ab.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 6\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie hat ihre Schwester abgeholt.</b></div>분리동사의 과거분사는 ab + ge + holt예요 (12과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"aa0df1fe34\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Ich trinke noch einen Kaffee, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich sehr müde bin.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) deshalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) aber</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) weil</button></div><div class=\"qe\">동사 bin이 끝에 있으니 종속접속사 weil이에요 (19·20과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"a2289836ad\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;anfängt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Kannst du mir sagen, wann das Spiel <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(anfangen)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">경기가 언제 시작하는지 말해 줄 수 있어?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Kannst du mir sagen, wann das Spiel <b>anfängt</b>?</div>간접의문문에서는 동사가 끝에 오고, 분리동사는 다시 붙어요 (11·20과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"51b31acb65\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich war müde deshalb bin ich früh ins Bett gegangen&quot;,&quot;Müde war ich deshalb bin ich früh ins Bett gegangen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 피곤해서 일찍 잠자리에 들었어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">deshalb</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">war</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">müde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">gegangen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">früh</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Bett</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">bin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">ins</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich war müde, deshalb bin ich früh ins Bett gegangen.</b></div>deshalb 뒤에 동사 bin, 그다음 주어 ich, 과거분사는 끝이에요 (12·13·19과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"12d0f57596\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"4\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 정치에 관심이 없어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">interessiere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">an</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Politik.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Ich interessiere mich nicht für Politik.</b></div>sich interessieren은 für와 함께 써요 (17·18과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4f153f8b92\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir sind im Hotel geblieben, weil es gestürmt hat.&quot;,&quot;Weil es gestürmt hat, sind wir im Hotel geblieben.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> weil로 한 문장으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir sind im Hotel geblieben. Es hat gestürmt.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 11\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir sind im Hotel geblieben, weil es gestürmt hat.</b></div>weil 문장에서는 보조 동사 hat이 맨 끝으로 가요 (12·20과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e30c658665\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Wohin hast du den Schlüssel gelegt? – <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Schublade.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) In der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) In den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Im</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) In die</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Wohin?은 4격이에요. die Schublade → in die (15과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"3e454a3257\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir mussten lange warten.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 과거형으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir müssen lange warten.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 13\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir mussten lange warten.</b></div>müssen의 과거형은 움라우트 없이 musste, wir에서 mussten이에요 (13과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"98251e26f6\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"4\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 그 휴가를 잘 기억해요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">erinnere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">gut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">auf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">Urlaub.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Ich erinnere mich gut an den Urlaub.</b></div>sich erinnern은 an + 4격과 함께 써요 (17·18과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"16462d9336\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ob&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Sie fragt, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> wir morgen Zeit haben.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 우리가 내일 시간이 있는지 물어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sie fragt, <b>ob</b> wir morgen Zeit haben.</div>Ja/Nein 질문을 문장 속에 넣을 때는 ob이에요 (20과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"615091c500\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Welcher Satz ist richtig?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Ich habe ihm das Buch gegeben, denn brauchte er es.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Ich habe ihm gegeben das Buch, denn er brauchte es.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) Ich habe ihm das Buch gegeben, denn er brauchte es.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Ich habe das Buch ihm gegeben, weil brauchte er es.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">denn은 어순을 바꾸지 않아요. 과거분사 gegeben은 끝이에요 (4·12·19과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"16\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 16</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"